    <h1>About AILEEN</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">The ones worth knowing</p>
  </section>

  <div class="article-body">
    <p>AILEEN Magazine is a luxury lifestyle journal focused on the things that earn their place in your life. Elegant travel, timeless style, recipes that feel like home, and the kind of intentional living that makes everyday a little more beautiful.</p>

    <p>I'm Aileen Lavin. I started this site because I was tired of content that felt like it was written for algorithms instead of people. Every restaurant guide that listed 47 places when you only needed five. Every "capsule wardrobe" that still had 200 pieces. Every travel guide that told you to "explore like a local" and then recommended tourist traps.</p>

    <p>AILEEN is the antidote. We focus on what's actually worth your time, your money, and your attention. Every recommendation is honest, personal, and tested. If it's on this site, it's because I've been there, tried it, or lived with it — and I'd recommend it to a friend.</p>

    <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>

    <p><strong>Travel</strong> — Hotel reviews, restaurant guides, and city itineraries for people who like to travel with intention. From Palm Beach to Bar Harbor, Boston to Aspen.</p>

    <p><strong>Style</strong> — Timeless wardrobe guides, quiet luxury picks, and the kind of style advice that ages well. No fast fashion, no trend-chasing.</p>

    <p><strong>Recipes</strong> — Simple, elegant recipes that feel like home. The kind of food you make for the people you love.</p>

    <p><strong>Lifestyle</strong> — Intentional living, beautiful homes, book recommendations, and the small choices that make everyday life feel more considered.</p>

    <h2>Work With Us</h2>

    <p>For collaborations, partnerships, and press inquiries: <a href="mailto:collaborations@aileenlavin.com">collaborations@aileenlavin.com</a></p>

    <p>We work with brands that align with AILEEN's editorial values — quality, elegance, and authenticity. We don't promote anything we wouldn't use ourselves.</p>
  </div>

